{
  "document": {
    "id": "where-next-tech-architecture",
    "name": "Where Next - Technical Architecture & Data Flow",
    "type": "FIGJAM",
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "frontend-layer",
        "name": "Frontend Layer",
        "type": "FRAME",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 200,
        "fills": [{"type": "SOLID", "color": {"r": 0.9, "g": 0.95, "b": 1, "a": 1}}],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "characters": "🖥️ FRONTEND LAYER (Next.js 14 + React + TypeScript)\n\nPages: / | /plan-trip | /suggestions | /trip/[id] | /booking/* | /ai-travel-agent | /tours | /cart | /saved\nComponents: TripPlannerForm | TripDetailsEnhanced | FlightPickerModal | HotelPickerModal | BudgetDashboard\nState: React useState/useEffect | URL Parameters | Local Storage | Session Storage",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontName": {"family": "Inter", "style": "Regular"}
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "api-layer",
        "name": "API Layer",
        "type": "FRAME",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 300,
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 150,
        "fills": [{"type": "SOLID", "color": {"r": 0.95, "g": 1, "b": 0.9, "a": 1}}],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "characters": "⚡ API LAYER (Next.js API Routes)\n\n/api/ai/suggestions | /api/amadeus/* | /api/payments/* | /api/trips | /api/status | /api/utils/currency\nValidation: Zod Schemas | Error Handling | Rate Limiting | Caching (LRU) | Authentication",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontName": {"family": "Inter", "style": "Regular"}
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "external-apis",
        "name": "External APIs",
        "type": "FRAME",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 500,
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 200,
        "fills": [{"type": "SOLID", "color": {"r": 1, "g": 0.95, "b": 0.9, "a": 1}}],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "characters": "🌐 EXTERNAL SERVICES\n\nOpenAI GPT-4o-mini: Trip suggestions, AI chat, itinerary generation\nAmadeus API: Flight search, hotel search, location data\nStripe: Payment processing, subscription management\nSupabase: Database, authentication, real-time data\nExchangeRate-API: Currency conversion\nOpenWeatherMap: Weather data, city search",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontName": {"family": "Inter", "style": "Regular"}
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "data-flow-1",
        "name": "Trip Planning Flow",
        "type": "FRAME",
        "x": 1600,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 300,
        "fills": [{"type": "SOLID", "color": {"r": 0.8, "g": 0.9, "b": 1, "a": 1}}],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "characters": "📋 TRIP PLANNING DATA FLOW\n\n1. User fills TripPlannerForm\n2. Form validates with Zod\n3. Data sent to /api/ai/suggestions\n4. API calls OpenAI with prompt\n5. AI returns 3 destinations\n6. Results cached (LRU)\n7. Suggestions displayed\n8. User clicks 'See Details'\n9. Navigate to /trip/[id]\n10. Load flight/hotel options",
            "fontSize": 12,
            "fontName": {"family": "Inter", "style": "Regular"}
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "data-flow-2",
        "name": "Booking Flow",
        "type": "FRAME",
        "x": 1600,
        "y": 400,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 300,
        "fills": [{"type": "SOLID", "color": {"r": 1, "g": 0.9, "b": 0.8, "a": 1}}],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "characters": "💳 BOOKING DATA FLOW\n\n1. User selects flight + hotel\n2. Click 'Buy Complete Trip'\n3. Navigate to /booking/checkout\n4. Fill traveler details\n5. Submit payment form\n6. Call /api/payments/create-session\n7. Stripe processes payment\n8. Redirect to /booking/confirmation\n9. Display booking details\n10. Send confirmation email",
            "fontSize": 12,
            "fontName": {"family": "Inter", "style": "Regular"}
          }
        ]
      },
      {
