            "characters": "🤖 OPENAI GPT-4O-MINI\n\n• Model: gpt-4o-mini\n• Max tokens: 1500\n• Timeout: 30 seconds\n• Prompt engineering\n• JSON response parsing\n• Budget validation\n• Fallback to seeded data",
            "fontSize": 11,
            "fontName": {"family": "Inter", "style": "Regular"}
          }
