          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "characters": "🧪 TESTING INFRASTRUCTURE\n\n• Jest: Unit tests, API integration tests\n• Playwright: E2E tests, cross-browser testing\n• Test Categories: AI integration, Payment flow, Amadeus API, Database ops\n• Performance benchmarks, Mobile responsive, Security validation\n• Accessibility testing, SEO testing, Analytics testing\n\n📊 Coverage: 750+ test scenarios across 12 categories",
